### Docker default; local default without integration profile is 8080.
@base = http://localhost:8082
@role = SUPERVISOR

### CORE compatibility (no user token required by default)
GET {{base}}/reference/aircraft-types/A320/checklist-template
Accept: application/json

### Published procedure in the original format
GET {{base}}/api/v1/references/procedure-templates/resolve?aircraft_type_code=A320&procedure_code=PRE_DEPARTURE
X-Demo-Role: {{role}}

### Aircraft types
GET {{base}}/api/v1/references/aircraft-types
X-Demo-Role: {{role}}

### Procedure version history
GET {{base}}/api/v1/references/procedure-templates/versions
X-Demo-Role: {{role}}

### Audit
GET {{base}}/api/v1/references/audit
X-Demo-Role: {{role}}

### With AUTH_ENABLED=true, replace demo headers with a real user access token.
# GET {{base}}/api/v1/references/aircraft-types
# Authorization: Bearer <user access token>
